WEBVTT

00:17:59.079 --> 00:18:02.098
Because if you actually compare the two,

00:18:02.122 --> 00:18:06.655
Tesla has kind of this mind
grab these days,

00:18:06.679 --> 00:18:08.678
but who actually changed the world?

00:18:09.853 --> 00:18:13.235
Edison may not have been a nice person,

00:18:13.259 --> 00:18:16.391
he did a lot of things --

00:18:16.415 --> 00:18:18.844
he was maybe not so intellectual,

00:18:18.868 --> 00:18:21.095
not so visionary.

00:18:21.119 --> 00:18:24.780
But I think I'm more
of an Edison than a Tesla.

00:18:25.669 --> 00:18:28.107
CA: So our theme at TED
this week is dreams --

00:18:28.131 --> 00:18:29.478
big, bold, audacious dreams.

00:18:29.502 --> 00:18:31.304
You're really the antidote to that.